# Changelog_FORK maintenance

When you add, change, or remove fork-specific code (anything that differs from the original [SmartTube](https://github.com/yuliskov/SmartTube)), update:

1. **CHANGELOG_FORK.md** (root) – add to the relevant subproject section (common, smarttubetv, MediaServiceCore summary)
2. **MediaServiceCore/CHANGELOG_FORK.md** – when changing files in the MediaServiceCore submodule

Include: file path, brief description of the change, and any new APIs or settings.
